---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Soutien scolaire">

  <section class="soutien-hero fade-in">
    <h1>Soutien scolaire <span class="highlight">Maths & Français</span></h1>
    <p>Des cours individuels en ligne pour les enfants de 6 à 10 ans. Une pédagogie Montessori bienveillante pour reprendre confiance et progresser à son rythme.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="matieres fade-in">
    <div class="matiere">
      <span class="matiere-icon"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E8644A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="6" y2="6"/><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="14" y2="18"/><path d="M16 10h.01"/><path d="M12 10h.01"/><path d="M8 10h.01"/><path d="M12 14h.01"/><path d="M8 14h.01"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/><path d="M8 18h.01"/></svg></span>
      <h2>Mathématiques</h2>
      <p>Numération, calcul, géométrie, résolution de problèmes. On reprend les bases avec patience et on construit des fondations solides.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="matiere">
      <span class="matiere-icon"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v16"/><path d="M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z"/></svg></span>
      <h2>Français</h2>
      <p>Lecture, écriture, grammaire, conjugaison. On travaille la compréhension et l'expression, à l'oral comme à l'écrit.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="avantages-soutien fade-in">
    <h2>L'approche Soroclub</h2>
    <div class="avantages-grid">
      <div class="avantage">
        <span><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"/><path d="M22 10v6"/><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Pédagogie Montessori</h3>
        <p>10 ans d'expérience. On s'adapte à l'enfant, pas l'inverse.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="avantage">
        <span><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m16 11 2 2 4-4"/><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/></svg></span>
        <h3>100% individuel</h3>
        <p>Un enseignant, un enfant. Attention totale et programme sur mesure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="avantage">
        <span><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E8644A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Bienveillance</h3>
        <p>Zéro pression. On encourage, on valorise les progrès, on dédramatise les erreurs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="avantage">
        <span><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2BAB7C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"/></svg></span>
        <h3>En ligne</h3>
        <p>Depuis chez toi, pas de déplacement. Pratique pour les parents, confortable pour l'enfant.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tarifs-soutien fade-in">
    <h2>Nos tarifs</h2>
    <div class="formats">

      <div class="format">
        <div class="format-header">
          <h3>⏱️ Séance de 30 min</h3>
          <p>Idéal pour les 6-8 ans</p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-body">
          <div class="formule">
            <div class="formule-info">
              <h4>Pack 4 séances</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="formule-prix">
              <span class="prix">28€</span>
              <span class="par-heure">soit 7€ / séance</span>
              <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/3cI5kF1xB74v0kWc071wY04" target="_blank" class="btn-acheter">Acheter</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="formule populaire">
            <div class="formule-tag">Meilleur rapport</div>
            <div class="formule-info">
              <h4>Pack 12 séances</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="formule-prix">
              <span class="prix">72€</span>
              <span class="par-heure">soit 6€ / séance</span>
              <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRmcN7ccf2OfaZA5BJ1wY03" target="_blank" class="btn-acheter">Acheter</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="formule carte">
            <div class="formule-info">
              <h4>À la carte</h4>
              <p>Sans engagement, réserve quand tu veux</p>
            </div>
            <div class="formule-prix">
              <span class="prix">10€</span>
              <span class="par-heure">/ séance</span>
              <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRm3cx9034Wn7Nofcj1wY09" target="_blank" class="btn-acheter">Acheter</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="format">
        <div class="format-header">
          <h3>🕐 Séance de 1h</h3>
          <p>Idéal pour les 8-10 ans</p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-body">
          <div class="formule">
            <div class="formule-info">
              <h4>Pack 4 séances</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="formule-prix">
              <span class="prix">56€</span>
              <span class="par-heure">soit 14€ / séance</span>
              <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/28EdRb2BF0G7gjU0hp1wY02" target="_blank" class="btn-acheter">Acheter</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="formule populaire">
            <div class="formule-tag">Meilleur rapport</div>
            <div class="formule-info">
              <h4>Pack 12 séances</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="formule-prix">
              <span class="prix">150€</span>
              <span class="par-heure">soit 12,50€ / séance</span>
              <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/6oU9AVforagH2t49RZ1wY01" target="_blank" class="btn-acheter">Acheter</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="formule carte">
            <div class="formule-info">
              <h4>À la carte</h4>
              <p>Sans engagement, réserve quand tu veux</p>
            </div>
            <div class="formule-prix">
              <span class="prix">18€</span>
              <span class="par-heure">/ séance</span>
              <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/14AaEZb8b1Kbc3E3tB1wY08" target="_blank" class="btn-acheter">Acheter</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-soutien fade-in">
    <h2>Envie d'essayer ?</h2>
    <p>Réserve un premier cours et vois la différence.</p>
    <a href="/reservation" class="cta">Cours d'essai — 5€</a>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .soutien-hero {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .soutien-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--bleu);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--corail);
  }

  .soutien-hero p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--texte);
    opacity: 0.85;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .matieres {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .matiere {
    background-color: var(--blanc);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .matiere:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .matiere-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .matiere h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--bleu);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .matiere p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--texte);
    opacity: 0.85;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .avantages-soutien {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .avantages-soutien h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--bleu);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .avantages-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .avantage {
    background-color: var(--blanc);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--corail);
    border-radius: 0 16px 16px 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .avantage:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .avantage span {
    font-size: 2rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .avantage h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--bleu);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .avantage p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--texte);
    opacity: 0.85;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .tarifs-soutien {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .tarifs-soutien h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--bleu);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .formats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .format {
    background-color: var(--blanc);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .format:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .format-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--corail) 0%, #D4553B 100%);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    color: var(--blanc);
  }

  .format-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .format-header p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .format-body {
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }

  .formule {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background-color: var(--creme);
    position: relative;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .formule.populaire {
    border: 2px solid var(--jaune);
    background-color: #fffdf5;
  }

  .formule.carte {
    border: 1px dashed var(--bleu);
    background-color: var(--blanc);
  }

  .formule-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--jaune);
    color: var(--blanc);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
  }

  .formule-info h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--bleu);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .formule-info p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--texte);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .formule-prix {
    text-align: right;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .prix {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--bleu);
  }

  .par-heure {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--texte);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .btn-acheter {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: var(--corail);
    color: var(--blanc);
    padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-acheter:hover {
    background-color: var(--corail-hover);
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .cta-soutien {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bleu) 0%, var(--bleu-clair) 100%);
    color: var(--blanc);
  }

  .cta-soutien h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cta-soutien p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: var(--jaune);
    color: var(--bleu);
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cta:hover {
    background-color: #e0950f;
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .soutien-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .soutien-hero {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    .matieres {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .formats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .formule {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }

    .formule-prix {
      align-items: center;
    }

    .cta-soutien {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
